/apps/2028730/movie.293x165.jpg?t=1683215579","hls":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/228260/11677/a7f715df6171e0a50bf37ec4925c049264ab65d1/1751248956/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1683215579","mp4":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steam/apps/2028730/movie480.mp4"}],"genres":["Indie","RPG","Strategy"],"features":["Single-player","Steam Achievements","Steam Cloud","Steam Trading Cards","Family Sharing"],"platforms":{"windows":true,"mac":false,"linux":false},"controller":null,"dev":["Stardock Entertainment"],"pub":["Stardock Entertainment"],"released":"May 22, 2013","meta":80,"langs":["English","German","Polish","Russian"],"min":[["OS","Windows 10 / 8 / 7 SP1 / Vista SP2 / XP SP3"],["Processor","2.2 GHz Dual Core Processor"],["Memory","2 GB RAM"],["Graphics","512 MB DirectX 9.0c Compliant Video Card w/Pixel Shader 2.0 (Radeon x1600 / GeForce 6800)"],["DirectX\u00ae","9.0c"],["Hard Drive","5 GB HD space"],["Sound","DirectX 9.0c Compatible Sound Card"]],"rec":[],"deck":1,"blurb":"Rebuilding after a magical Cataclysm is the task in Fallen Enchantress: Legendary Heroes, a turn-based fantasy 4X game set in the world of Elemental. The player grows a single settlement into an empire by founding cities, training armies and expanding, while quests and monsters such as liches and banshees press in from outside. Champions are drawn to the ruler according to the fame the realm has earned, and the sovereign and champions develop along skill trees.\n\nBecause each game plays out differently, campaigns differ on replay. It is a single-player strategy game from Stardock, the company behind Galactic Civilizations. It fits 4X fans who like role-playing elements, such as heroes and quests, added to empire building."}}